WEBVTT

00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:16,270
best protocol for Candida and yeast overgrowth.

00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:22,670
Feeling through all these episodes, we're going to get questions like this and these are

00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:23,990
very honest questions.

00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:27,550
What's the best protocol?

00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:37,310
The truth is, is that there isn't – I don't know how to say this really nicely, but

00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:43,350
I know we are so conditioned through the medical system that here's my – I've gotten

00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:50,550
to this diagnosis, however I've gotten to this diagnosis, give me the medication to

00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:53,550
a go away.

00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:57,950
That's not really in my mind the proper way to take care of somebody.

00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:02,430
The proper way to take care of somebody is, okay, maybe we have this diagnosis but let's

00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:04,750
ask a question, why?

00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:06,070
Why is it there?

00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,990
Is it because you have a deficiency of this Candida supplement?

00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:13,510
That's why you have Candida, though that might really help.

00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:17,270
We're not going to ultimately help the patient unless we dig to why.

00:01:17,270 --> 00:01:25,270
Is there an imbalance in the microbiota because of what?

00:01:25,270 --> 00:01:26,870
Let's figure that out.

00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:30,750
If we can figure that out and treat that, maybe we don't even have to seek that other

00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:39,750
supplement, right, or that drug or whatever, so it's not – I wish I could – why are

00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:41,110
you going to be mad at me?

00:01:41,110 --> 00:01:46,390
I ask you the questions of just giving me a supplement, they're just giving me a medication

00:01:46,390 --> 00:01:53,190
or giving me a solution, that's not the right way to take care of somebody in my book.

00:01:53,190 --> 00:02:00,710
Sure, there's a ton of – every supplement company that we use has a Candida protocol.

00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:09,830
But then are we being just like the practice of medicine, so different than having a

00:02:09,830 --> 00:02:14,830
Birk manual that a medical doctor follows and he or she is just a technician, and they

00:02:14,830 --> 00:02:18,950
come to this diagnosis because we did this lab and here's the diagnosis, here's the drug

00:02:18,950 --> 00:02:24,430
that we give by come back in three months and we'll see how you're doing and see if we've

00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:25,950
altered the lab value.

00:02:25,950 --> 00:02:34,670
Maybe you will, but did you help the person in any real way, did you really correct the

00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:36,510
reason why?

00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:46,630
This is – we could do the same thing in natural realms too, I don't like doing that.

00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:51,350
I don't really have a good answer for that, I apologize, my answer would be we need to dig

00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:56,270
it to dig deeper to figure out the reasons why.

